# Data access — forbidden to bypass repository

## Forbidden in feature code (services, helpers, controllers, processors)

- Injecting or calling `PrismaService` / `PrismaClient`
- Calling `prisma.<model>.*` directly
- Calling `$transaction` on Prisma client — use `TransactionService.execTx`

## Required

- **Reads/writes:** `*Repository` from `defineAppRepo`
- **Transactions:** `TransactionService.execTx` with `invalidate: 'none'` + `afterCommit` → `invalidateCache`
- **ESLint:** `@prismakit/eslint-plugin` recommended config

## Allowed Prisma client usage

- Inside `@prismakit/*` internals
- Inside `**/repositories/**` only (via factory delegate)

See [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md), [`docs/CACHE.md`](../../docs/CACHE.md), and [`docs/CREATE_PRISMA_REPOSITORY.md`](../../docs/CREATE_PRISMA_REPOSITORY.md).
